[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3097102700","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108801#issuecomment-3097102700","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108801","id":3097102700,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64mgls","user":{"login":"Storm-Dev6","id":188445215,"node_id":"U_kgDOCztyHw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188445215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6","html_url":"https://github.com/Storm-Dev6","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Storm-Dev6/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T14:49:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T14:50:20Z","body":"Hi @OrderX8,\n\nThanks for documenting this issue — I can confirm this behavior also happens on my macOS setup.\n\n✅ Summary:\nLaunchpad only shows one Godot app, even when multiple versions are installed.\n\nThis is likely due to identical CFBundleIdentifiers in the Info.plist of each app.\n\nModifying the identifier alone doesn't solve it, as Launchpad might cache bundle info or require additional metadata changes.\n\n💡 Workaround suggestions:\n1 - Rename the .app bundles before placing them in /Applications, e.g.:\n```Godot_4.4.1.app```\n```Godot_4.5b3.app```\n\n2 - Use an app like [Launchpad Manager](https://launchpadmanager.com/) to force manual entries (note: third-party software, use with caution).\n\n3 - Instead of Launchpad, consider using:\n\nAlfred, Raycast, or Spotlight for version-specific launching.\n\nOr create separate Dock aliases for each version.\n\n\n🧩 Possible solution:\nIf this is to be addressed upstream, maybe the export template or .dmg builder could include a unique CFBundleIdentifier per version, like:\n\n```org.godotengine.godot.44```\n```org.godotengine.godot.45b3```\n\nThis might help Launchpad treat them as separate entries.\n\nLet me know if you'd like help testing modified .plist files!\n\nBest regards, 😄  👍 \n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3097102700/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3109319707","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108801#issuecomment-3109319707","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108801","id":3109319707,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc65VHQb","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https